# doubt-solver.ai — MVP Build Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **Duolingo-style education platform** frontend with 9 interactive pages, full gamification system, and polished dark-theme UI — all in a single session.

## Tech Stack
- **Next.js 16** (App Router, TypeScript)
- **Framer Motion** (animations)
- **Lucide React** (icons)
- **Vanilla CSS** (700+ line design system)

## Pages Built

| Page | Route | Highlights |
|---|---|---|
| Landing | `/` | Animated hero, features grid, CTA |
| Dashboard | `/dashboard` | XP bar, streak, leaderboard, subject cards |
| Exam/Quiz | `/dashboard/exam` | 3-phase interactive quiz with feedback |
| Doubt Solver | `/dashboard/doubts` | AI chat with simulated responses |
| Leaderboard | `/dashboard/leaderboard` | Leagues, rankings, trend indicators |
| Badges | `/dashboard/badges` | Earned/locked grid with progress |
| Subjects | `/dashboard/subjects` | 5 subjects, topic-level progress bars |
| Analytics | `/dashboard/analytics` | XP chart, subject bars, AI recommendations |
| Settings | `/dashboard/settings` | Profile, notifications, appearance |

