## Build Verification
- ✅ `npm run build` — 0 errors, 11 routes statically generated
- ✅ Browser verification — all pages render correctly
- ✅ Responsive design — desktop-optimized with mobile-ready CSS

## Project Structure

```
src/app/
├── globals.css              # 700-line design system
├── layout.tsx               # Root layout + SEO
├── page.tsx                 # Landing page
└── dashboard/
    ├── layout.tsx           # Sidebar navigation
    ├── page.tsx             # Dashboard home
    ├── exam/page.tsx        # Interactive quiz
    ├── doubts/page.tsx      # AI doubt solver chat
    ├── leaderboard/page.tsx # Rankings + leagues
    ├── badges/page.tsx      # Achievements
    ├── subjects/page.tsx    # Subject explorer
    ├── analytics/page.tsx   # Performance analytics
    └── settings/page.tsx    # User settings
```

## What's Next (Phase 2)
1. Supabase Auth integration (Google login)
2. Gemini Flash API for real AI question generation
3. pgvector RAG with NCERT textbook content
4. XP/streak persistence in PostgreSQL
5. Deploy to Vercel
